   prove experimentally the quantum nature of light via the quantum
   amplitude superposition of two indistinguishable photons. We have
   implemented this experiment as an advanced undergraduate laboratory
   experience. We were able to overcome well known difficulties with this
   experiment using recently reported techniques by Thomas et al. {[}Rev.
   Sci. Instr. 80, 036101 (2009),].},
