   two orbits for the action of the group of homeomorphisms of the space
   onto itself. Certain conditions on a continuum X are known under which
   the suspension over X is 1/2-homogeneous {[}17]. In this paper we
   determine sufficient conditions under which the nth suspension of a
   Hausdorff space is 1/2-homogeneous. (C) 2013 Elsevier B.V. All rights
