   assess the taxonomic status of five names associated with species of
   Mexican Anolis. We find A. schmidti to be a junior synonym of A.
   nebulosus, A. breedlovei to be a junior synonym of A. cuprinus, A.
   polyrhachis to be a junior synonym of A. rubiginosus, A. simmonsi to be
   a junior synonym of A. nebuloides, and A. adleri to be a junior synonym
   of A. liogaster.},
